Evidence: static dashboard Capability Center.

The dashboard nav registers `Capability Center` through the existing static
router. The page reads `dashboard/state/capabilities-status.json` when present
and renders capability cards with status badge, owner_boundary chips,
configured/missing lists, pending probes, and next actions partitioned into
automatable and human-required work.

No Firebase Auth, Firestore, Cloud Functions, or Firebase realtime surface is
required to render the page.
